        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2555] Once a new SessionID has been assigned to the V2G Session, the EVCC should calculate SHA512 hash of the SessionID of the V2G session concatenated with the hash generated by [V2G20-2635]. Refer to [V2G20-2106], [V2G20-2626] and [V2G20-2627] for details of SessionID assignment.",
            "block_bbox": [
                137,
                167,
                1120,
                272
