        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2638] When the EVCC receives the SessionID value in the SessionSetupRes for the V2G communication session that it is trying to resume, the EVCC should calculate the SHA512 hash of the SessionID received in SessionSetupRes message concatenated with the hash generated by [V2G20-2558].",
